        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "LOCATION\n\nLocated just a short drive from Westport town in the townland of Ballinlough. It is accessed via the N59 and then onto a local roadway, with picturesque views of the surrounding farmland.\n\nWestport is a thriving coastal town located on Wild Atlantic way and positioned on the shores of Clew Bay. Long renowned as a visitor location, the town attracts a large numbers of visitors and tourists annually. Well connected with road, rail and within 50 minis of Ireland West Airport. Local amenities include Croagh Patrick, Westport House Estate, Blue Flag beaches, championship golf, fresh and salt water fishing, The Greenway and Achill Island, etc.\n \nDESCRIPTION\n\nComprises a 4 bedroom detached dormer bungalow with large garage. Built about 20 years, the property extends to c 2,250sq.ft and is built of traditional rendered block with double glazed uPVC windows under a pitched slate roof which incorporates a number of Velux windows. This is a bright spacious house that is generally in good condition.\n \nThe houses sits on a generous plot of 0.22 hectares (0.54 acres). The property features stone built front wall and entrance, with tarmac drive and rendered block built detached garage. All in all, this is a fine family home.\n \nFEATURES\n\n•Located just a 6 minute drive from Westport with access off the N59\n•Substantial detached 4 bed dormer bungalow of 232.25 sq m ( 2,500 sq.ft)\n•Includes large detached garage/workshop\n•Large landscaped gardens front and back - site area of 0.22 hec (0.54 acres)\n\n· 4 BED, 4 BATHROOMS\n· 2 reception rooms and open plan\n· 2 solid fuel stoves in ground floor living and dining rooms\n· uPVC double glazing\n· OFCH\n· Good natural light throughout with a number of Velux windows\n· Large detached garage\n· Landscaped site of 0.22 hec (0.54 acres)\n· Tarmac drive\n\nTITLE\n\nRegistered Freehold title held within Folio MY46267F.\n \nSERVICES\n\nThe property has the following services:-\n\nSewerage- On-site septic tank\nWater- Mains\nElectricity- Mains \nTelecoms- Yes \nHeating- Oil fired central heating\n \n\n\nACCOMMODATION COMPRISES: \n \nGROUND FLOOR\n\nENTRANCE HALL:6.17m x 2.37m\nTiled and oak flooring\n\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM:4.6m x 4.48m plus 3.21m x 3.43m\nDining area tiled floor, extensive glazing, wood burning stove\nKitchen area Shaker-style units, Formica worktop, stainless steel sink, tiled splash back, 4 ring electric hob & oven, extractor fan\n\n\nUTILITY ROOM:3.21m x 1.97m\nTiled floor, floor & eye level units, Formica worktop\n\nREAR HALLWAY:1.74m x 1.57m\nTiled floor, plastered and painted walls\n\nTOILET:1.55m x 1.35m\nWc, whb, plastered and painted walls, tiled floor\n\nLIVING ROOM:3.97m x 4.46m\nVaulted ceiling, hard wood floors, brick surround fireplace, wood burning stove, plastered and painted walls\n\nCENTRAL HALLWAY:1.18m x 4.7m\nPolished timber floor, plastered and painted walls\n\nBATHROOM:1.84m x 3.23m\nTiled floor, bath with shower, tiled surround, wc, whb, vanity unit, overhead mirror\n\nBEDROOM (1):3.25m x 3.22m\nTimber floor, sliding wardrobes\n\nENSUITE SHOWER ROOM:1.02m x 3.21m\nWc, whb, shower with tiled surround, tiled floor, wall mounted mirror, overhead shaving light\n\nBEDROOM (2):3.25m x 3.21m\nSliding wardrobes, timber floor, plastered and painted walls\n\nBEDROOM (3)/ OFFICE:3.23m x 3.23m\nPolished timber floor, plastered and painted walls\n \nFIRST FLOOR\nAccess to First Floor via softwood timber staircase with carpet\nLANDING:\n\nLIVING ROOM (2):\n\nBATHROOM:\n\n\nBEDROOM (4):\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR RETURN\n\nENSUITE SHOWER ROOM:\n\nWALK IN CLOSET:\n\n\nHOTPRESS:\n\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nGARAGE:\n3.45m x 2.37m\nSmall office area, carpeted floor, vaulted ceiling with Velux window\n\n4.5m x 5.14m\n4 x Velux windows, vaulted ceiling, timber floor, plastered and painted walls\n\n2.0m x 2.08m\nTiled floor, wc, whb, shower, Velux window\n\n4.49m x 3.42m\nVaulted ceiling, double Velux window, plastered and painted walls, timber floor\n\n2.56m x 1.57m\nPlastered and painted walls, wc, whb, electric shower with tiled surround, vaulted ceiling with Velux window\n\n1.7m x 1.85m\nCarpeted floor, Velux window\n\n2.0m x 1.45m\nFully shelved\n\n10.34m x 5.58m\nDouble front door, side door, fairfaced block walls, concrete floor\n\nASKING PRICE 525,000\n\nBER C 104860929\n\nVIEWINGS\n\nStrictly by appointment only. Please contact O'Toole & Co. on 098 28000 \n\nDIRECTIONS\n\nProperty is located 5.2kms north of Westport via the N59 and then onto a local roadway. Follow google maps directions for Eircode F28 XF54\n"
